    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Every morning, look after the cohorts\nThree things go wrong quietly: an enrolment is never paid, a\nstudent never gets joining instructions, and the seat count on\na cohort drifts from reality. All three surface only when it is\ntoo late to fix them, so they are checked daily.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "321889292106",
      "name": "1. Every morning, look after the cohorts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Decide what each enrolment needs\nAn unpaid enrolment gets a chase, at most every third day \u2014 a\ndaily chase reads as harassment and gets marked as spam. A paid\none gets joining instructions three days before the cohort\nstarts. Nothing gets both on the same day.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "567294649017",
      "name": "2. Decide what each enrolment needs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chase, welcome, reconcile\nEvery message goes through the send workflow, so a student who\nopted out is refused here like anywhere else. Seat counts are\nrewritten from what the enrolments actually say.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 2180,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "935830465533",
      "name": "3. Chase, welcome, reconcile",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        160
      ]
    }
